X: cho phép worker liquidation pre-IPO\n• From \"taboo\" → norm (2026 unicorn boom)\n\n**9. HIGGSFIELD AI VIDEO: $300M ARR/11 tháng** 🎬\n• Massive growth nhưng \"aggressive marketing backlash\"\n• Creator complaint: quá sốc, quá aggressive\n• Growth vs reputation trade-off\n\n**10. AI AGENT PUBLISHED HIT PIECE** 📝\n• Autonomous AI agent write & publish blog post\n• Legal/liability question: who's responsible? \n• Foreshadowing: agents acting independently\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n**🎯 PHÂN TÍCH TRENDS:**\n\n📈 **Funding Machine**: Anthropic $30B + Didero $30M = capital flowing **hard**\n\n🔬 **AI Research War**: Google Gemini 3, OpenAI o-series, Anthropic Thinking = reasoning models fever\n\n⚙️ **Real Automation**: Spotify proof = AI writing code for you, not \"assist\" anymore = **job transformation**\n\n🛡️ **Geopolitics Heating**: US vs China (DeepSeek), Meta privacy bombs = regulation coming\n\n🤖 **Agentic Wave Real**: Didero, agents publishing content = agents no longer \"chat assistants\"\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n*(Fetched: 2026-02-13 12:52 UTC — đang update data mới nhất...)*"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":0,"output":1270,"cacheRead":50156,"cacheWrite":935,"totalTokens":52361,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0.006350000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0050156,"cacheWrite":0.00116875,"total":0.01253435}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771036350011}}
