{"type":"message","id":"1be685f1","parentId":"b9cdfe03","timestamp":"2026-02-24T10:59:02.854Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ Python Engine `.env` copied! Bây giờ để tôi hiển thị cần sửa và tạo file chứa instructions:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_018U7iMm7BML5gRLi3M2KX9u","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/Users/phanphuong/TaxAssistant/ENV_SETUP_GUIDE.md","content":"# Environment Configuration Guide\n\n## 📋 Các biến cần sửa (Required Fields)\n\n### 1. Node-Gateway (node-gateway/.env)\n\n**TELEGRAM:**\n```\nTELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=<BỘT TOKEN TỪ @BotFather>\nTELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_URL=<YOUR_DOMAIN/webhook/telegram>\nTELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=<RANDOM_SECRET>\n```\n\n**ZALO (Optional - nếu dùng):**\n```\nZALO_APP_ID=<YOUR_ZALO_APP_ID>\nZALO_APP_SECRET=<YOUR_ZALO_APP_SECRET>\nZALO_OA_ACCESS_TOKEN=<YOUR_OA_TOKEN>\nZALO_OA_REFRESH_TOKEN=<YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN>\nZALO_WEBHOOK_SECRET=<RANDOM_SECRET>\n```\n\n**Database (Optional - nếu dùng PostgreSQL):**\n```\nPOSTGRES_URL=postgresql://taxapp:taxapp_dev@localhost:5432/taxassistant\n```\n\n**Redis (Optional - nếu dùng):**\n```\nREDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Python-Engine (python-engine/.env)\n\n**CRITICAL - OpenAI API:**\n```\nOPENAI_API_KEY=<YOUR_OPENAI_API_KEY>\nLLM_MODEL=gpt-4o\nLLM_TEMPERATURE=0.3\n```\n\n**Database (Optional):**\n```\nPOSTGRES_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://taxapp:taxapp_dev@localhost:5432/taxassistant\n```\n\n**Redis (Optional):**\n```\nREDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔑 Cách lấy các tokens\n\n### Telegram Bot Token\n1. Chat với @BotFather trên Telegram\n2. `/newbot` → tạo bot\n3. Lấy token từ response\n\n### OpenAI API Key\n1. Truy cập https://platform.openai.com/api-keys\n2. Click \"Create new secret key\"\n3. Copy key\n\n### Zalo OA (Optional)\n1. Đăng ký Developer account trên Zalo\n2. Tạo OA → lấy credentials\n3. Setup webhook nếu cần\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Checklist\n\n- [ ] `node-gateway/.env` - TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN filled\n- [ ] `node-gatewa