{"type":"compaction","id":"f91f038a","parentId":"7a8ab482","timestamp":"2026-02-28T02:37:12.255Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Set up and maintain AI news digest delivery system via Telegram with proper RSS feed handling\n2. Configure OpenClaw system to avoid model loopback and concurrency issues\n3. Create/manage reminders for subscription renewals and task tracking\n4. Provide user consultations (Valentine gift, technical setup)\n5. Install Docker Desktop via Homebrew\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Must follow SKILL.md format strictly for news reports (1️⃣-2️⃣ format, 15 intl + 5 Vietnam, topic distribution)\n- AI news reports: exactly 20 articles (split into 2 Telegram messages if too long)\n- maxConcurrent = 1 (sequential, no race conditions)\n- No model loopback in fallbacks (Sonnet removed, only Haiku allowed)\n- Vietnam feeds have 10s timeout protection, limited to 5 entries each\n- Reminders via Apple Reminders (`remindctl` CLI)\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Fixed ai-news-digest script hang issues (Vietnam feeds timeout)\n- [x] Added signal-based timeout handler (10s per feed)\n- [x] Reduced Vietnam feed entries from 10 → 5\n- [x] Script now reliably fetches 20 articles in ~30 seconds\n- [x] Multiple successful news deliveries to Telegram (20/02, 21/02, 23/02)\n- [x] Fixed OpenClaw config: removed Claude Sonnet from fallbacks, set maxConcurrent=1\n- [x] Resolved \"too many chats\" error\n- [x] Created 3 reminders: Kimi (10/03), Anthropic (07/03), Claude Code task (19/02)\n- [x] Consulted on Valentine gift (SK-II/Estée Lauder skincare or Charles & Keith bag, budget 1-2M)\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Docker Desktop installation via `brew install --cask docker` (pending)\n\n### Blocked\n- Claude Code enhancement task is **OVERDUE** (due 18/02, not yet completed)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Vietnam feeds disabled initially, then re-enabled with timeout**: Feeds were causing 30s+ hangs. Solution: signal timeout (10s) + reduced entry limit (5 vs 30).\n- **Model fallback