{"type":"compaction","id":"6ff24551","parentId":"d6ad6d92","timestamp":"2026-03-05T18:23:18.184Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Set up and maintain AI news digest delivery system via Telegram with RSS feed handling + TTS audio generation\n2. Configure OpenClaw system to avoid model loopback and concurrency issues\n3. Create/manage reminders and tasks using Apple Reminders (native macOS via `remindctl`)\n4. Deploy and manage TaxAssistant Docker microservices (gateway, tax-engine, postgres, redis)\n5. Integrate external TTS API for audio report generation\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Must follow SKILL.md format strictly for news reports (1️⃣-2️⃣ format, 15 intl + 5 Vietnam, topic distribution)\n- AI news reports: exactly 20 articles (split into 2 Telegram messages if too long)\n- maxConcurrent = 1 (sequential, no race conditions)\n- No model loopback in fallbacks (Sonnet removed, only Haiku allowed)\n- Vietnam feeds have 10s timeout protection, limited to 5 entries each\n- **Reminders:** Apple Reminders (via `remindctl` CLI) - no Microsoft 365/Todo\n- **TTS Audio:** Chunked generation (30-50 word chunks, parallel curl calls, ffmpeg concat) using user's TTS API endpoint\n- **TaxAssistant:** Docker compose deployment with proper container orchestration\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Fixed ai-news-digest script hang issues (Vietnam feeds timeout)\n- [x] Added signal-based timeout handler (10s per feed)\n- [x] Reduced Vietnam feed entries from 10 → 5\n- [x] Multiple successful news deliveries (20/02, 21/02, 23/02, 2/3, 3/3/2026)\n- [x] Fixed OpenClaw config: removed Claude Sonnet from fallbacks, set maxConcurrent=1\n- [x] Created 3 reminders: Kimi (10/03), Anthropic (07/03), Claude Code task\n- [x] Switched from Microsoft 365 Todo → Apple Reminders (native, no auth required)\n- [x] Created EnsoAI task list in Apple Reminders with 7 business tasks\n- [x] Attempted TTS audio integration with user's API (chunking + parallel + ffmpeg)\n- [x] Created `tts_chunked.py` (pydub) and `tts_chunked_curl.py` (subprocess curl)\n- [x] TaxAssistant Docker deployment: `git pull` + `docker compose up --build -d`\n- [x] Verified all TaxAssistant services running (gateway:3000, engine:8000, postgres:5432, redis:6379)\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] TTS API server stability issue (first call succeeds, subsequent calls return 500 error)\n- [ ] TaxAssistant Docker restart: pull again + `docker compose down && compose up --build-recreate -d`\n\n### Blocked\n- **TTS API Server:** Returns \"Không thể tạo audio\" error after first successful call. Possible server crash/rate-limit/session limit issue. Awaiting user server restart/fix.\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Vietnam feeds with timeout**: Disabled initially due to hangs, re-enabled with 10s signal timeout + 5-entry limit (vs 30). Solution prevents 30s+ delays.\n- **Model fallback structure**: Removed Claude Sonnet to prevent exponential sub-agent spawning. Only Haiku as fallback.\n- **maxConcurrent=1**: Sequential processing prevents race conditions and rate-limit violations. More stable than parallel.\n- **Microsoft 365 → Apple Reminders**: Device flow OAuth too complex for non-interactive OpenClaw environment. Switched to native macOS `remindctl` CLI (no auth, simple).\n- **TTS approach (curl vs Python requests)**: Python `requests` library has encoding issues with Vietnamese UTF-8 in JSON. Switched to subprocess `curl` calls (proven working).\n- **TTS chunking strategy**: Initial attempt with `pydub` failed (missing dependencies). Switched to `ffmpeg` concat (reliable, tested).\n- **TaxAssistant deployment**: Docker compose used for multi-service orchestration (Node gateway, Python engine, PostgreSQL, Redis).\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **TTS API Fix (CRITICAL)**: Bệ hạ restart TTS server or check logs for \"Không thể tạo audio\" error. Server appears to crash/rate-limit after first request.\n2. **TaxAssistant Restart**: \n   ```bash\n   cd ~/TaxAssistant\n   git pull origin claude/tax-assistant-sme-Lrchg\n   docker compose down && docker compose up --build --force-recreate -d\n   ```\n3. **Complete overdue task**: Enhance Claude Code coder description (due 18/02 - OVERDUE)\n4. **Monitor subscription reminders**: Anthropic (06/03), Kimi (09/03)\n5. **Test TTS audio generation** once API server is stable: run `tts_chunked_curl.py` with news report text\n\n## Critical Context\n\n### File Paths\n- News script: `/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/scripts/fetch_rss.py`\n- TTS scripts: \n  - `/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/scripts/tts_chunked.py` (pydub)\n  - `/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/scripts/tts_chunked_curl.py` (curl subprocess)\n- Config: `/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/openclaw.json`\n- SKILL.md: `/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/SKILL.md`\n- Apple Reminders list: `EnsoAI` (7 tasks)\n- TaxAssistant: `~/TaxAssistant/` (branch: `claude/tax-assistant-sme-Lrchg`)\n\n### TTS API Endpoint\n```bash\n# Endpoint\nhttps://tts-enso.ai-enso.com/api/tts\n\n# Working format (exact spacing):\ncurl --location 'https://tts-enso.ai-enso.com/api/tts' \\\n  --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  --data '{ \"text\": \"Vietnamese text here\", \"voice\": \"voice1\" }' \\\n  --output output.wav\n\n# Response: Binary WAV (WAVE audio, Microsoft PCM, 16 bit, mono 24000 Hz)\n# Success: 200 OK + WAV file\n# Failure: 500 error + JSON: {\"error\":\"Không thể tạo audio\"}\n```\n\n### Apple Reminders Commands\n```bash\n# List tasks in EnsoAI\nremindctl list EnsoAI --json\n\n# Add task\nremindctl add \"Task title\" --list EnsoAI --due 2026-03-06\n\n# Check all pending\nremindctl all --json | jq '.[] | select(.isCompleted == false)'\n\n# Complete task\nremindctl complete <task-id> --list EnsoAI\n```\n\n### TaxAssistant Services (Running)\n```\nGateway: taxassistant-gateway (Up 38 min) → http://localhost:3000\nTax Engine: taxassistant-tax-engine (Up 16h) → http://localhost:8000 (gRPC 50051)\nPostgreSQL: taxassistant-postgres (Up 4d) → localhost:5432\nRedis: taxassistant-redis (Up 4d) → localhost:6379\n```\n\n### EnsoAI Reminder Tasks\n1. Cung cấp báo giá Crawler cho TPBank\n2. Crawler cho ABB\n3. Ocr cho ABB\n4. Sales: công bố cơ chế cho Sales?\n5. Sales → cần mạnh mẽ hơn → gọi cho 50 doanh nghiệp chào POD\n6. Enso.Liability kết hợp với Sapo/Kiotviet/Basevn?\n7. Yêu cầu trình bày phần AI platform của team Enso\n\n### Reminders Status\n- **Overdue**: Claude Code coder description (18/02)\n- **Active**: EnsoAI list (7 tasks, no due dates)\n- **Upcoming**: Anthropic subscription (06/03), Kimi subscription (09/03)\n\n### Recent News Delivery Stats\n- 28/02: 94 articles → 20 top (1m13s)\n- 01/03: 79 articles → 20 top (1m8s)\n- 02/03: 74 articles → 20 top (1m29s)\n- 03/03: 74 articles → 20 top (1m50s)\n- Format: ~500 words, 3-paragraph structure, Markdown + dividers\n\n### Known Issues\n1. **TTS API Server Instability**: Returns \"Không thể tạo audio\" (500 error) after first successful request. Suspected: server crash, rate limiting per session, or memory leak. Awaiting user investigation.\n2. **Claude Code Task Overdue**: Due 18/02, still pending enhancement. Blocked on user providing exact requirements (Facebook post reference).\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nUser requested to pull the latest code and then restart Docker services with the command: `docker compose down && docker compose up --build --recreate -d`\n\n## Early Progress\n- Assistant executed a git pull command for the branch `claude/tax-assistant-sme-Lrchg`\n- Pull was successful with 8 files changed: 213 insertions, 8 deletions\n- Changes included new GitHub workflows, updated Dockerfiles, modifications to Python tax engine core files, and addition of requirements.txt\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- Git pull completed successfully with latest code from origin\n- Docker Compose configuration and both tax-engine (Python 3.11) and gateway (Node 20) Dockerfiles were updated\n- Ready for Docker Compose restart with rebuild and recreation of containers\n- Working directory: ~/TaxAssistant\n\n<read-files>\n/Users/phanphuong/.nvm/versions/node/v25.6.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/apple-reminders/SKILL.md\n/Users/phanphuong/.nvm/versions/node/v25.6.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/gog/SKILL.md\n/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md\n/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/SKILL.md\n/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/references\n/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/references/rss_sources.md\n/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/scripts/fetch_rss.py\n/tmp/ai_news.json\n/tmp/ai_news_20.json\n/tmp/ai_news_complete.json\n/tmp/ai_news_fresh.json\n/tmp/ai_news_latest.json\n/tmp/ai_news_today.json\n~/.nvm/versions/node/v25.6.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tts.md\n</read-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"56a3c7eb","tokensBefore":180360,"details":{"readFiles":["/Users/phanphuong/.nvm/versions/node/v25.6.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/apple-reminders/SKILL.md","/Users/phanphuong/.nvm/versions/node/v25.6.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/gog/SKILL.md","/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md","/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/SKILL.md","/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/references","/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/references/rss_sources.md","/Users/phanphuong/.openclaw/workspace/skills/ai-news-digest/scripts/fetch_rss.py","/tmp/ai_news.json","/tmp/ai_news_20.json","/tmp/ai_news_complete.json","/tmp/ai_news_fresh.json","/tmp/ai_news_latest.json","/tmp/ai_news_today.json","~/.nvm/versions/node/v25.6.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tts.md"],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":false}
