{"type":"message","id":"bbcb7d61","parentId":"ed0eae7a","timestamp":"2026-03-06T11:25:43.265Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01CsWf1kQ8z6ybfkdoCxvrRm","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-03-06 Memory Log\n\n## TTS Audio Generation - Complete Workflow\n\n### Critical Finding: OpenClaw Default TTS Quality is VERY POOR\n- ⚠️ **NEVER use OpenClaw's built-in TTS** (Edge TTS) - quality severely degraded\n- ✅ **ALWAYS use Bệ hạ's custom TTS API** at `https://tts-enso.ai-enso.com/api/tts`\n- Updated TOOLS.md with this critical note\n\n### Audio Generation Method: Chunked + Parallel + FFmpeg\n**Process that worked (14 min 40 sec total):**\n1. Split text into 40-word chunks (9 chunks from ~1300 char report)\n2. Call TTS API in parallel (max 3 workers) for each chunk\n3. Concatenate WAV files with ffmpeg\n4. Result: 3.0 MB, 65-second high-quality audio\n\n**Timing Breakdown:**\n- TTS API calls: ~8-10 minutes (bottleneck - each chunk takes 50-80 sec)\n- ffmpeg concat: ~2-3 minutes\n- Overhead: ~1-2 minutes\n- **Total: 880 seconds (14 min 40 sec)**\n\n### Audio Output Directory\n- **Path:** `~/.openclaw/workspace/audio/`\n- All future audio files save here\n- File format: `ai_news_YYYYMMDD.wav`\n- Example: `ai_news_20260305.wav` (3.0 MB, 65s)\n\n### Telegram Upload Limitation (OpenClaw Gateway)\n- Message tool has strict security sandbox\n- Cannot send files from ANY local path (workspace, /tmp, /home, etc.)\n- Attempted workarounds all failed: symlinks, different directories, etc.\n- **Solution for Bệ hạ:** Use Airdrop, SSH/SCP, or file manager to download\n\n## TaxAssistant Deployment Status\n- ✅ Latest git pull: `claude/tax-assistant-sme-Lrchg` (2 files updated)\n- ✅ Docker restart: `docker compose down && up -d`\n- ✅ All 4 services running:\n  - Gateway: taxassistant-gateway (port 3000-3001)\n  - Tax Engine: taxassistant-tax-eng (port 8000, gRPC 50051)\n  - PostgreSQL: postgres:16-alpine (port 5432)\n  - Redis: redis:7-alpine (port 6379)\n\n## AI News Digest Status\n- ✅ Cron job fixed (model: Kimi → Haiku)\n- ✅ Daily 8AM delivery working\n- ✅ 20-article format + audio generation implemented\n- 📰 Latest delivery: 5/3/2026 with audio (chunked TTS)\n\n## Reminders & Tasks\n### Inbox\n- 🔴 OVERDUE: Claude Code task (due 18/02)\n- ⏰ Anthropic subscription: 06/03 (3 days away)\n- ⏰ Kimi subscription: 09/03 (6 days away)\n\n### EnsoAI List (7 pending tasks, no due dates)\n1. Cung cấp báo giá Crawler cho TPBank\n2. Crawler cho ABB\n3. OCR cho ABB\n4. Sales: công bố cơ chế cho Sales?\n5. Sales → gọi cho 50 doanh nghiệp chào POD\n6. Enso.Liability kết hợp với Sapo/Kiotviet/Basevn?\n7. Yêu cầu trình bày phần AI platform của team Enso\n\n## Cron Jobs\n- ✅ AI News Digest @ 8AM daily (Haiku model)\n- Status: Enabled, ready for next run\n\n## Important Notes for Future Sessions\n1. **TTS API Slow:** 50-80 sec per 1300-char chunk. Plan accordingly for long texts.\n2. **Memory Update:** Remember workspace/audio is the correct output directory now.\n3. **GitHub Integration:** OpenClaw has GitHub skill (`gh` CLI), ready to implement issue automation.\n4. **Model Fallbacks:** Only Haiku allowed (removed Sonnet to prevent exponential sub-agent spawning).\n5. **maxConcurrent=1:** Sequential processing prevents race conditions.\n\n## Next Actions (for Bệ hạ or future sessions)\n1. ⏰ Monitor subscription renewals (Anthropic 06/03, Kimi 09/03)\n2. 🔴 Complete overdue Claude Code task\n3. 🎯 Set due dates for EnsoAI tasks\n4. 📰 Monitor daily AI news delivery at 8AM\n5. 🎙️ Integrate TTS audio delivery to daily news workflow\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772796343262}}
